                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game would appeal to very, very few people.\n\nIf you're not a [I]hardcore[/I] fan of hidden-object games, stop right here: this game is absolutely not for you. It's pretty much all just one hidden-object scene after another.\n\nFor the hardcore fans: all hidden-object scenes are randomized, but always have the same set of items and the same basic instructions. Even the music is the same in all scenes.\n\nSo it's [I]extremely[/I] repetitive.\n\nThere is a simple story told in text and images between the hidden-object scenes.",
